    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5099" root="حد" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَحِدٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَجْدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْحَدُ</span></b>  (K)
A man <i>niggardly,</i> or <i>avaricious;</i> (S;) <i>possessing
little good.</i> (S, K.) [Hence,] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ جَحْدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Dry
land, in which is no good.</i> (L.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَامٌ جَحِدٌ</span>,
(S,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَحْدٌ</span></b> , (A,) <i>A year in which is little
rain.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَحِدٌ</span>, A <i>thick and short</i>
horse: fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِحَادٌ</span>. (K.)

